[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Version=1.5
Name=Knowledge
Name[de]=Wissen
Comment=Your timeline, projects and what the system recorded about them
Comment[de]=Deine Zeitleiste, Projekte und was das System dazu aufgezeichnet hat
Exec=arlen-knowledge
Icon=arlen-knowledge
Terminal=false
Categories=Utility;
Keywords=timeline;history;knowledge;graph;activity;projects;
Keywords[de]=zeitleiste;verlauf;wissen;graph;aktivitaet;projekte;
StartupNotify=true
# The identity the permission system keys on, stated so the launcher's idea of
# who this app is matches the daemons'. The resolver's rule (3) reads the
# directory below /usr/lib/arlen/apps/, which the image install path sets to this
# same id.
#
# Note this is the APP, `dev.arlen.knowledge`. The daemon that holds the graph is
# `knowledge`, a different principal with its own profile: this window reads and
# may be closed at any time, the daemon records whether it is open or not. They
# are not one identity wearing two hats, and the delete path in particular has to
# tell them apart - the app asks, the daemon is what carries it out.
X-Arlen-AppId=dev.arlen.knowledge
